msgid "# Step-5-Preview (Experimental)"
msgstr "# Step-5-Preview（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"**Step-5-Preview** is a next-generation flagship Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) "
"model developed by StepFun. The model has **600B** total parameters, with "
"**27B** active per token, and supports a 1M-token context window and vision "
"input."
msgstr ""
"**Step-5-Preview** 是阶跃星辰（StepFun）研发的下一代旗舰级混合专家（MoE）模型。该模型总参数量为 **600B**，每个 "
"token 激活 **27B** 参数，支持 1M token 上下文窗口以及视觉输入。"

msgid ""
"This document describes how to quickly get started with `Step-5-Preview` "
"model inference deployment on Ascend NPU using vLLM-Ascend, based on W8A8 "
"quantized weights."
msgstr ""
"本文档介绍如何基于 W8A8 量化权重，使用 vLLM-Ascend 在昇腾 NPU 上快速完成 `Step-5-Preview` 模型的推理部署。"

msgid "**Current status and constraints**"
msgstr "**当前状态与约束**"

msgid ""
"- `Step-5-Preview` is provided **out-of-the-box** through the official Docker image `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler`. The supporting code has **not yet been merged** into the vLLM-Ascend repository, so installing it from source (`pip install` or building from source) is **not supported** for this model yet.\n"
"    - Only **950DT products** is supported now. Other Ascend hardware (e.g., Atlas A3 Products) is not supported for `Step-5-Preview`.\n"
"    - The features listed in [Supported Features](#2-supported-features) are only those enabled by the verified deployment commands in this document, and do **not** imply that all features are supported for `Step-5-Preview`. This is an early-access version; performance optimization and reliability validation are still in progress (see [Declaration](#9-declaration))."
msgstr ""
"- `Step-5-Preview` 通过官方 Docker 镜像 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler` **开箱即用**。配套代码**尚未合入** vLLM-Ascend 仓库，因此该模型暂**不支持**源码安装（`pip install` 或源码编译）。\n"
"    - 当前仅支持 **Ascend 950DT系列产品**。其他昇腾硬件（例如 Atlas A3系列产品）不支持 `Step-5-Preview`。\n"
"    - [支持的特性](#2-supported-features) 中列出的特性仅为本文件中已验证的部署命令所启用的特性，**并不**意味着 `Step-5-Preview` 支持所有特性。这是早期体验版本，性能优化与可靠性验证仍在进行中（参见 [声明](#9-declaration)）。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Supported Features "
"List](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参考 [支持的特性列表](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) "
"获取该模型支持的特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参考 [特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) 获取特性的配置方法。"

