"command matches this directory."
msgstr ">**路径说明**：将模型权重下载到您选择的目录并记录该路径。请确保后续部署命令中的模型路径与该目录一致。"

msgid "### 3.2 Hardware and Software Preparation"
msgstr "### 3.2 软硬件准备"

msgid ""
"| Hardware | Ascend HDK | CANN version | torch_npu version | vLLM | vLLM-"
