msgstr "开始之前，请确认固件/驱动已正确安装。推荐使用 HDK 25.5.0 版本。运行以下命令进行确认；输出头部显示的版本即为 HDK 版本。"

msgid "### 3.3 Verify Multi-node Communication (Optional)"
msgstr "### 3.3 验证多节点通信（可选）"

msgid ""
"If you want to deploy a multi-node environment, verify multi-node "
"communication as described in [Verify inter-node "
