"interconnect)."
msgstr ""
"如果您要部署多节点环境，请按照 "
"[验证节点间连通性](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-"
"interconnect) 中的说明验证多节点通信。"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

msgid "#### Download Docker Image"
msgstr "#### 下载 Docker 镜像"

msgid "#### Create Docker Container"
msgstr "#### 创建 Docker 容器"

msgid "Use the following command to create the container."
msgstr "使用以下命令创建容器。"

msgid ""
"The `-v` option maps directories. **You should map the weight directory into"
" the container** so that the weights can be accessed inside the container. "
"The local weight path is `/mnt/weight`; modify it according to the actual "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"`-v` 选项用于映射目录。**您应将权重目录映射到容器中**，以便在容器内访问权重。本地权重路径为 `/mnt/weight`；请根据实际情况修改。"

msgid "Enter the container interactive environment:"
msgstr "进入容器交互环境："

msgid "### 4.2 Source Code Installation"
msgstr "### 4.2 源码安装"

msgid ""
"`Step-5-Preview` is currently provided **out-of-the-box** via the "
"`quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler` Docker image. Because the "
"supporting code has **not yet been merged** into the vLLM-Ascend repository,"
" source-code installation is **not supported** for this model yet; please "
"use the Docker image as described in [4.1 Docker Image "
"Installation](#41-docker-image-installation)."
msgstr ""
"`Step-5-Preview` 目前通过 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:step5-a5-openeuler` Docker"
" 镜像**开箱即用**。由于配套代码**尚未合入** vLLM-Ascend 仓库，该模型暂**不支持**源码安装；请按照 [4.1 Docker "
"镜像安装](#41-docker-image-installation) 中的说明使用 Docker 镜像。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid "### 5.1 Multi-Node Co-Located Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 多节点混布部署"

msgid ""
"DP=4 multi-node deployment with TP=4 per dp rank extends the context to 1M. "
"Update `WEIGHT_PATH`, `LOG_PATH`, `local_ip`, `node0_ip`, and `IFNAME` based"
" on the actual environment."
msgstr ""
"DP=4 多节点部署，每个 dp rank 使用 TP=4，可将上下文扩展至 1M。请根据实际环境更新 "
"`WEIGHT_PATH`、`LOG_PATH`、`local_ip`、`node0_ip` 和 `IFNAME`。"

msgid "Run the following command on node 0:"
msgstr "在节点 0 上运行以下命令："

msgid "Run the following command on node 1:"
msgstr "在节点 1 上运行以下命令："

msgid ""
"> Note: `--data-parallel-address` is set to the local IP (i.e., the "
"coordinator) on Node 0, and to the head node IP on Node 1; `--data-parallel-"
"start-rank` is only set on the headless node."
msgstr ""
"> 注意：在节点 0 上，`--data-parallel-address` 设置为本地 IP（即协调节点）；在节点 1 上，设置为头节点 "
"IP；`--data-parallel-start-rank` 仅在无头节点上设置。"

msgid ""
"Because the weights are large, the load time is related to the disk read "
"speed, and the first load usually takes about 10 minutes. The following logs"
" indicate that the service has been started successfully:"
msgstr "由于权重较大，加载时间与磁盘读取速度有关，首次加载通常需要约 10 分钟。以下日志表示服务已成功启动："

msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid "| Feature | Description | Configuration |"
msgstr "| 特性 | 说明 | 配置 |"

msgid ""
"| Tensor Parallel (TP) | Splits the model across all 4 NPUs within a node. |"
" `--tensor-parallel-size 4` |"
msgstr "| 张量并行（TP） | 将模型切分到节点内的全部 4 个 NPU 上。 | `--tensor-parallel-size 4` |"

msgid ""
"| Expert Parallel (EP) | Distributes the MoE experts across NPUs. | "
"`--enable-expert-parallel` |"
msgstr "| 专家并行（EP） | 将 MoE 专家分布到各个 NPU 上。 | `--enable-expert-parallel` |"

msgid ""
"| Data Parallel (DP) | Multi-node DP across 2 nodes, extending the context "
"to 1M. | `--data-parallel-size 4` |"
msgstr "| 数据并行（DP） | 跨 2 个节点的多节点 DP，可将上下文扩展至 1M。 | `--data-parallel-size 4` |"

msgid ""
"| Speculative Decoding (MTP) | Uses the native MTP layer for Multi-Token "
"Prediction. | `--speculative-config '{\"method\": \"mtp\", "
"\"num_speculative_tokens\": 3}'` |"
msgstr ""
"| 投机推理（MTP） | 使用原生 MTP 层进行多 token 预测。 | `--speculative-config '{\"method\": "
"\"mtp\", \"num_speculative_tokens\": 3}'` |"

msgid ""
"| Decode Graph Capture | Captures the decode phase into a graph to reduce "
"kernel launch overhead. | `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": "
"\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` |"
msgstr ""
"| Decode 图捕获 | 将 decode 阶段捕获为图，以降低 kernel 启动开销。 | `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` |"

msgid ""
"| Data parallelism for shared experts | Use data parallelism to deploy "
"shared experts | `\"enable_shared_expert_dp\": true` |"
msgstr "| 共享专家数据并行 | 使用数据并行部署共享专家 | `\"enable_shared_expert_dp\": true` |"

msgid ""
"| Shared-expert overlap | Overlaps shared-expert execution with other work |"
" `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` |"
msgstr ""
"| 共享专家重叠 | 将共享专家的执行与其他工作重叠 | `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` |"

msgid ""
"> **Note:** The features listed above are the ones enabled in the verified "
"deployment commands in this document. Other features, such as LoRA, Pipeline"
" Parallel, and Prefill-Decode Disaggregation, are not verified in this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"> **注意：** 上文列出的功能是在本文档已验证的部署命令中启用的功能。其他功能，如 LoRA、流水线并行（Pipeline Parallel）和 "
"Prefill-Decode 分离部署，未在本文档中验证。"

